-- title:
--   Original Gaussian strict stopped cash contradiction with unconditional finite dividend integral
-- statement:
--   On the genuine positive-drift Gaussian centered Brownian tube, the exact strict Stieltjes cash and terminal reward violate the disputed fixed-band cash inequality for bounded source noise. The original discounted integral finiteness is now guaranteed by B163, avoiding the additional finiteness hypothesis in Proved B155. Positive probability of the actual native event and identification of the physical-grid noise limit still require proof.

